Olası Sorun - Hive user hadoopa bağlanamaz ise;

Resolution
As a workaround, please follow the below steps :
 
1) Set "hadoop.proxyuser.hive.hosts" to *
 
Ambari > HDFS > configs > hadoop.proxyuser.hive.hosts=*
 
Save the changes and Restart the required services
 
(Or)
 
2) Set "hive.metastore.event.db.notification.api.auth" to false 
 
Ambari > Hive > Configs > Custom hive-site.xml, add the following:
 
hive.metastore.event.db.notification.api.auth=false
 
Save the changes and Restart the required services
